      "type": "heading",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": 1,
      "md_text": "EXTRA KEYS ON THE KEYBOARD",
      "bbox": [
        140,
        309,
        672,
        422
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0064_seg_001"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "Both the Amiga 2000 and 500 feature 94-key keyboards, as compared to the A1000's 89-key keyboard. (The European versions of the keyboards have 96 keys.) The new keys are all located on the numeric keypad, and include:",
      "bbox": [
        788,
        307,
        2031,
        504
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0064_seg_002"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "",
      "bbox": [
        986,
        557,
        1926,
        852
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0064_seg_003"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "In PC mode on the Amiga 2000 (using a Bridgeboard), these keys assume typical PC functions, including Number lock (left parenthesis), Print screen (asterisk) and Scroll lock (right parenthesis).",
      "bbox": [
        789,
        909,
        2013,
        1057
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0064_seg_004"
    },
    {
      "type": "prose",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "On some keyboards, the left Amiga key has been replaced by the Commodore key. This key performs identically in either case.",
      "bbox": [
        790,
        1111,
        1983,
        1208
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0064_seg_005"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": 2,
      "md_text": "Keyboard Layout Showing Raw Key Codes",
      "bbox": [
        790,
        1353,
        1874,
        1420
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0064_seg_006"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": 1,
      "md_text": "RAW KEY CODES ON THE KEYBOARD",
      "bbox": [
